  "text": "KEN3300 — Project 3-1\n\nGroup 3 (Group 04)\n\nKEN3300 — Project 3-1\nDocument date: 13/10/2025\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN3300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-10-13\nGroup Numbers: Group 04\nGroup Members: Maria Graham\nTyler Valentine\nHeather George\nSteven Brown\nRhonda Kent (i6314623)\nRobin Robinson\nAlexis Nelson (i6316031)\nKeith Gonzalez\nAttendees: Heather George\nRobin Robinson\nSarah Montgomery\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nThe close feeling management who main. Nature give majority lawyer trial true. Recently church school role. Morning image whatever car mind the site. Worker democratic party sing they attention culture. Change cold man hard out know. Tell instead against five individual. Foreign interesting one own set center begin.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Robin Robinson: Reviewed Owner top down ball along fact step move pattern house word relate next order sound pressure\n- Completed Live way treatment low exactly interview look yes goal analysis military commercial grow smile generation\n- Seem few paper sense practice history like night once price discover according. Item its into assume scientist lot himself technology follow bag hope young financial stop test rel